      501.36,
      296.57,
      607.43
    ],
    "text": "An allotment of land called Siyambalagahawatta andKoswattahena in total extent of 0.9890 hectare depicted aslots 65, 66, 67, 68 and 69 in Sheet No. 04, supplement No.03 of the Final Village Plan No. 254 situated in the villagecalled Indigetawela in the Grama Niladhari Division ofIndigetawela in Giruwapattuwa East in the DivisionalSecretariat's Divisional of Angunakolapelessa inHambantota District of the Southern Province and morefully described as follows.",
